      "kind": "page_text",
      "text": "Statistical Process Control\n\n• A control chart is a graphical tool for monitoring the activity of an\n  ongoing process.\n• Control charts are sometimes referred to as Shewhart control charts,\n  because Walter A. Shewhart first proposed their general theory.",
