          {
            "bbox": [
              25.2,
              289.06,
              707.23,
              341.86
            ],
            "text": "control limits or a non-random pattern is exhibited, special causes are \nassumed to exist, and the process is said to be out of control.",
            "block_type": 0
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              7.2,
              352.88,
              690.79,
              380.63
            ],
            "text": "• Common Cause (As per Deming 85%): If quality characteristic values",
            "block_type": 0
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              25.2,
              385.44,
              703.58,
              467.04
            ],
            "text": "are within control limits and no non-random pattern is visible, it is \nassumed that a system of common causes exists and that the process \nis in a state of statistical control.",
            "block_type": 0
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              271.22,
              502.85,
              451.3,
              514.85
            ],
            "text": "ME3327E QUALITY, RELIABILITY AND",
